        "id": 1944405
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-10T17:53:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If snapshot is called with a running VM, we want the VM to go back to the same running state.\n\nI removed this code as it\u0027s done within crosvm.",
      "parentUuid": "26c6d0f6_677e899b",
